@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. GET Semua Menu (Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Satu Menu Berdasarkan ID - Berhasil (Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/11
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET Satu Menu Berdasarkan ID - Tidak Ditemukan (Status: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/9999
Accept: application/json

### 4. POST Tambah Menu Baru dengan image_url (URL Link via JSON) - (Status: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cireng ayam suwir pedas",
  "description": "Dibuat dengan cimol dengan isian ayam suwir pedas",
  "icon": "bi bi-cup-straw",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546069901-ba9599a7e63c"
}

### 5. POST Tambah Menu Baru dengan Multipart Form (Upload File Gambar / Link) - (Status: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Cireng Krispi Spesial
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Cireng krispi gurih dengan isian ayam suwir pedas nagih
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="icon"

bi bi-fire
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image_url"

https://example.com/cireng.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. POST Tambah Menu Baru - Validasi Gagal (Status: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### 7. PUT Ubah Menu Berdasarkan ID via JSON (Status: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/5
Content-Type: application/json

{   
  "name": "cireng ayam suwir",
  "description": "Dibuat dengan cimol dengan isian ayam suwir pedas",
  "icon": "bi bi-cup-straw",
  "image_url": "https://img-global.cpcdn.com/recipes/e3b0de81b9f35ec3/1200x630cq80/photo.jpg"
}

### 8. PUT Ubah Menu Berdasarkan ID via Multipart Form (Upload File / Link) - (Status: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/5
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Salad Buah Premium
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Salad buah premium segar dengan saus fla keju spesial
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="icon"

bi bi-star-fill
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image_url"

https://img-global.cpcdn.com/recipes/e3b0de81b9f35ec3/1200x630cq80/photo.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 9. PUT Ubah Menu Berdasarkan ID - Tidak Ditemukan (Status: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menu Fiktif",
  "description": "Menu yang tidak ada di database",
  "icon": "bi bi-question"
}

### 10. DELETE Hapus Menu Berdasarkan ID - Berhasil (Status: 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/5 

### 11. DELETE Hapus Menu Berdasarkan ID - Tidak Ditemukan (Status: 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/9999

### 12. POST Upload File Gambar Mandiri (Status: 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="contoh.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample.png
--WebAppBoundary--
